{"seq":2,"slug":"alloy","title":"Alloy 轻量形式化建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application/alloy","wordCount":1163,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"alloy-轻量形式化建模\">Alloy 轻量形式化建模</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Alloy 是由 MIT 的 Daniel Jackson 设计的轻量级形式化建模语言和分析工具。Alloy 的核心理念是&quot;小范围假说&quot;（Small Scope Hypothesis）——大多数软件错误可以在小规模的实例中被发现。基于这一假说，Alloy 在用户指定的有限范围（Scope）内穷举搜索所有可能的实例，寻找满足约束的模型或违反断言的反例。</p>\n<p>与 TLA+ 侧重于动态行为验证不同，Alloy 更擅长分析数据模型和结构约束。它使用基于关系的声明式语言，非常适合验证 API 设计、数据库模式、安全策略和配置约束等。对于程序员而言，Alloy 可以看作是&quot;可执行的 UML 类图&quot;——它让设计在被实现之前就能被自动检查。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Alloy 模型] --&gt; B[Alloy Analyzer]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Kodkod 引擎]&#10;    C --&gt; D[SAT 求解器]&#10;    D --&gt; E{有解?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[可视化实例]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[无反例/不可满足]&#10;    A --&gt; H[签名 Sig]&#10;    A --&gt; I[关系 Relation]&#10;    A --&gt; J[事实 Fact]&#10;    A --&gt; K[断言 Assert]&#10;    A --&gt; L[谓词 Pred]\">graph TD\n    A[Alloy 模型] --&gt; B[Alloy Analyzer]\n    B --&gt; C[Kodkod 引擎]\n    C --&gt; D[SAT 求解器]\n    D --&gt; E{有解?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[可视化实例]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[无反例/不可满足]\n    A --&gt; H[签名 Sig]\n    A --&gt; I[关系 Relation]\n    A --&gt; J[事实 Fact]\n    A --&gt; K[断言 Assert]\n    A --&gt; L[谓词 Pred]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Alloy</th>\n<th>UML</th>\n<th>ER 图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确性</td>\n<td>数学精确</td>\n<td>半形式化</td>\n<td>半形式化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可分析</td>\n<td>自动分析</td>\n<td>不可分析</td>\n<td>不可分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态行为</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n<td>序列图/状态图</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束表达</td>\n<td>一阶关系逻辑</td>\n<td>OCL（可选）</td>\n<td>参照完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反例生成</td>\n<td>自动生成</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习成本</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具支持</td>\n<td>Alloy Analyzer</td>\n<td>多种UML工具</td>\n<td>数据库工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"alloy-语言基础\">Alloy 语言基础</h2><p>Alloy 的语言基于一阶关系逻辑（First-Order Relational Logic）。所有的数据都用关系（Relation）表示——原子（Atom）是最基本的实体，关系是原子元组的集合。签名（Signature）定义了原子的类型和它们之间的关系。</p>\n<p>一个文件系统的 Alloy 模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"sig Name {}&#10;&#10;abstract sig FSObject {}&#10;sig File extends FSObject {}&#10;sig Dir extends FSObject {&#10;  contents: set FSObject,&#10;  parent: lone Dir&#10;}&#10;&#10;sig FileSystem {&#10;  root: Dir,&#10;  objects: set FSObject&#10;}&#10;&#10;fact TreeStructure {&#10;  all fs: FileSystem | {&#10;    fs.root in fs.objects&#10;    all o: fs.objects - fs.root | one o.~contents &amp; fs.objects&#10;    no fs.root.parent&#10;    all d: Dir &amp; fs.objects | d.contents in fs.objects&#10;    no d: Dir | d in d.^(~contents.contents)&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;assert NoPartition {&#10;  all fs: FileSystem | all o: fs.objects |&#10;    o = fs.root or fs.root in o.^parent&#10;}&#10;&#10;check NoPartition for 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sig Name {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract sig FSObject {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig File extends FSObject {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig Dir extends FSObject {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  contents: set FSObject,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  parent: lone Dir</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig FileSystem {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  root: Dir,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  objects: set FSObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fact TreeStructure {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all fs: FileSystem | {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fs.root in fs.objects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    all o: fs.objects - fs.root | one o.~contents &#x26; fs.objects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    no fs.root.parent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    all d: Dir &#x26; fs.objects | d.contents in fs.objects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    no d: Dir | d in d.^(~contents.contents)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert NoPartition {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all fs: FileSystem | all o: fs.objects |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    o = fs.root or fs.root in o.^parent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check NoPartition for 5</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Alloy 的关键语法元素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sig A {}</code></td>\n<td>签名（类型声明）</td>\n<td><code>sig Person {}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>extends</code></td>\n<td>子类型</td>\n<td><code>sig Student extends Person {}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>field: Type</code></td>\n<td>关系字段</td>\n<td><code>friends: set Person</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>one/lone/set/some</code></td>\n<td>多重度</td>\n<td><code>parent: lone Dir</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fact {}</code></td>\n<td>全局约束</td>\n<td><code>fact { all p: Person | ...}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pred name[...] {}</code></td>\n<td>谓词</td>\n<td><code>pred add[...] {...}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>assert name {}</code></td>\n<td>断言</td>\n<td><code>assert NoLoop {...}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>check assert for N</code></td>\n<td>验证断言</td>\n<td><code>check NoLoop for 5</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>run pred for N</code></td>\n<td>搜索实例</td>\n<td><code>run add for 4</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关系逻辑与导航\">关系逻辑与导航</h2><p>Alloy 的表达能力来自其丰富的关系运算符。关系在 Alloy 中不仅用于描述数据结构，还用于表达复杂的导航路径和约束条件。</p>\n<p>关系运算符总结：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算符</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.</code></td>\n<td>连接（Join）</td>\n<td>关系组合</td>\n<td><code>p.friends</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-&gt;</code></td>\n<td>笛卡尔积</td>\n<td>构造关系</td>\n<td><code>Person -&gt; Person</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;</code></td>\n<td>交集</td>\n<td>共同元素</td>\n<td><code>A &amp; B</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>+</code></td>\n<td>并集</td>\n<td>合并</td>\n<td><code>A + B</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-</code></td>\n<td>差集</td>\n<td>移除</td>\n<td><code>A - B</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~</code></td>\n<td>转置</td>\n<td>反向关系</td>\n<td><code>~parent = children</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>^</code></td>\n<td>传递闭包</td>\n<td>可达性</td>\n<td><code>^parent = 所有祖先</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>*</code></td>\n<td>自反传递闭包</td>\n<td>含自身的可达性</td>\n<td><code>*parent</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#</code></td>\n<td>基数</td>\n<td>集合大小</td>\n<td><code>#friends &gt; 3</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>in</code></td>\n<td>子集</td>\n<td>包含关系</td>\n<td><code>A in B</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>利用这些运算符，可以简洁地表达复杂的结构约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"sig Node {&#10;  edges: set Node&#10;}&#10;&#10;fact DAG {&#10;  no n: Node | n in n.^edges&#10;}&#10;&#10;fact Connected {&#10;  all n1, n2: Node | n2 in n1.*edges&#10;}&#10;&#10;pred addEdge[n1, n2: Node, edges&#39;: Node -&gt; Node] {&#10;  n2 not in n1.*edges&#10;  edges&#39; = edges + n1 -&gt; n2&#10;}&#10;&#10;assert AddPreservesDAG {&#10;  all n1, n2: Node, edges&#39;: Node -&gt; Node |&#10;    addEdge[n1, n2, edges&#39;] implies&#10;    no n: Node | n in n.^edges&#39;&#10;}&#10;&#10;check AddPreservesDAG for 6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sig Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  edges: set Node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fact DAG {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  no n: Node | n in n.^edges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fact Connected {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all n1, n2: Node | n2 in n1.*edges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pred addEdge[n1, n2: Node, edges': Node -> Node] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  n2 not in n1.*edges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  edges' = edges + n1 -> n2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert AddPreservesDAG {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all n1, n2: Node, edges': Node -> Node |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addEdge[n1, n2, edges'] implies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    no n: Node | n in n.^edges'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check AddPreservesDAG for 6</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Alloy Analyzer 的可视化功能将找到的实例或反例以图形方式展示，使得抽象的关系约束变得直观可理解。这对于团队讨论设计方案非常有价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全策略与访问控制建模\">安全策略与访问控制建模</h2><p>Alloy 在安全策略验证中有独特的优势。访问控制模型（如 RBAC、ABAC）本质上是关系结构上的约束，非常适合用 Alloy 建模。</p>\n<p>一个基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"sig User {}&#10;sig Role {}&#10;sig Permission {}&#10;sig Resource {}&#10;&#10;sig RBAC {&#10;  userRoles: User -&gt; set Role,&#10;  rolePerms: Role -&gt; set Permission,&#10;  permResources: Permission -&gt; set Resource&#10;}&#10;&#10;pred canAccess[rbac: RBAC, u: User, r: Resource] {&#10;  some p: Permission |&#10;    p in rbac.userRoles[u].rbac.rolePerms and&#10;    r in rbac.permResources[p]&#10;}&#10;&#10;pred addRole[rbac, rbac&#39;: RBAC, u: User, role: Role] {&#10;  rbac&#39;.userRoles = rbac.userRoles + u -&gt; role&#10;  rbac&#39;.rolePerms = rbac.rolePerms&#10;  rbac&#39;.permResources = rbac.permResources&#10;}&#10;&#10;assert SeparationOfDuty {&#10;  all rbac: RBAC, u: User |&#10;    let roles = rbac.userRoles[u] |&#10;      not (AdminRole in roles and AuditRole in roles)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sig User {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig Role {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig Permission {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig Resource {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig RBAC {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  userRoles: User -> set Role,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rolePerms: Role -> set Permission,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  permResources: Permission -> set Resource</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pred canAccess[rbac: RBAC, u: User, r: Resource] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  some p: Permission |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    p in rbac.userRoles[u].rbac.rolePerms and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r in rbac.permResources[p]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pred addRole[rbac, rbac': RBAC, u: User, role: Role] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rbac'.userRoles = rbac.userRoles + u -> role</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rbac'.rolePerms = rbac.rolePerms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rbac'.permResources = rbac.permResources</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert SeparationOfDuty {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all rbac: RBAC, u: User |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let roles = rbac.userRoles[u] |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      not (AdminRole in roles and AuditRole in roles)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过 Alloy 的自动分析，可以检查安全策略中是否存在权限泄露、职责分离违反或不一致的配置。这些问题在手工审查中很容易遗漏，但 Alloy 的穷举搜索能够系统地发现所有可能的违规场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"软件设计验证\">软件设计验证</h2><p>Alloy 的另一个重要应用是在编码之前验证软件设计的正确性。Daniel Jackson 在其著作《Software Abstractions》中提倡&quot;先建模，后编码&quot;的开发方法——通过 Alloy 模型快速探索设计空间，发现设计中的缺陷，然后再投入实现工作。</p>\n<p>以 REST API 设计为例，可以用 Alloy 验证 API 的状态转换是否正确：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"abstract sig Status {}&#10;one sig Draft, Published, Archived extends Status {}&#10;&#10;sig Article {&#10;  var status: Status&#10;}&#10;&#10;pred publish[a: Article] {&#10;  a.status = Draft&#10;  a.status&#39; = Published&#10;  all other: Article - a | other.status&#39; = other.status&#10;}&#10;&#10;pred archive[a: Article] {&#10;  a.status = Published&#10;  a.status&#39; = Archived&#10;  all other: Article - a | other.status&#39; = other.status&#10;}&#10;&#10;assert NoDirectArchive {&#10;  all a: Article |&#10;    always (a.status = Draft implies after a.status != Archived)&#10;}&#10;&#10;check NoDirectArchive for 3 Article, 10 steps\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>abstract sig Status {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>one sig Draft, Published, Archived extends Status {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sig Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var status: Status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pred publish[a: Article] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  a.status = Draft</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  a.status' = Published</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all other: Article - a | other.status' = other.status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pred archive[a: Article] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  a.status = Published</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  a.status' = Archived</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all other: Article - a | other.status' = other.status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assert NoDirectArchive {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  all a: Article |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    always (a.status = Draft implies after a.status != Archived)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check NoDirectArchive for 3 Article, 10 steps</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[需求分析] --&gt; B[Alloy 建模]&#10;    B --&gt; C[自动分析]&#10;    C --&gt; D{发现反例?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[修改设计]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[设计确认]&#10;    F --&gt; G[编码实现]&#10;    G --&gt; H[对照模型测试]\">graph LR\n    A[需求分析] --&gt; B[Alloy 建模]\n    B --&gt; C[自动分析]\n    C --&gt; D{发现反例?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[修改设计]\n    E --&gt; B\n    D --&gt;|否| F[设计确认]\n    F --&gt; G[编码实现]\n    G --&gt; H[对照模型测试]</pre><p>Alloy 的局限性在于它只能在有限范围内进行分析——如果在范围 5 内没有发现反例，不能保证在更大范围内也没有。但实践经验表明，小范围假说在绝大多数场景中是成立的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Alloy 基于小范围假说，在有限范围内穷举搜索来发现设计缺陷</li>\n<li>Alloy 使用一阶关系逻辑，通过签名和关系描述数据模型和约束</li>\n<li>关系运算符（连接、闭包、转置等）使得复杂的导航和约束表达简洁</li>\n<li>Alloy 适合验证安全策略、API 设计、数据模型等结构性问题</li>\n<li>可视化功能将抽象的反例转化为直观的图形，有助于团队讨论</li>\n<li>&quot;先建模，后编码&quot;的方法能够在设计阶段发现大量缺陷</li>\n<li>Alloy 的局限是有限范围分析，但小范围假说在实践中通常成立</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Alloy 轻量形式化建模","id":"alloy-轻量形式化建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Alloy 语言基础","id":"alloy-语言基础"},{"level":2,"text":"关系逻辑与导航","id":"关系逻辑与导航"},{"level":2,"text":"安全策略与访问控制建模","id":"安全策略与访问控制建模"},{"level":2,"text":"软件设计验证","id":"软件设计验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TLA+ 形式化规约语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application/tla-plus"},"next":{"title":"形式化方法的工业应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/formal-methods/industrial-application/formal-methods-in-industry"}}